0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 670.39 Td (end-to-end JavaScript development across both client and server tiers. Its native) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 656.89 Td (JSON document exchange and non-blocking asynchronous event loop maximize performance) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 643.39 Td (and development velocity.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 625.89 Td (Q2: How does JSON Web Token \(JWT\) authentication work in FreelanceHub?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 608.39 Td (A: Upon login, the server cryptographically signs a payload containing the user ID) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 594.89 Td (with a private secret key. The client stores this token in localStorage and attaches) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 581.39 Td (it via an Axios interceptor to the Authorization: Bearer <token> header for all) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 567.89 Td (protected route requests.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 550.39 Td (Q3: Why choose MongoDB over traditional SQL databases for this project?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 532.89 Td (A: Freelance jobs and profiles possess dynamic structures \(variable skill arrays,) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 519.39 Td (proposal collections, varying client info\). MongoDB's document-oriented JSON model) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 505.89 Td (provides flexible schema agility without requiring alter table database migrations.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 488.39 Td (Q4: What is BCrypt and what is the function of salt rounds?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 470.89 Td (A: BCrypt is an adaptive cryptographic hash function. Salt rounds \(configured to 10\)) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 457.39 Td (specify the computational difficulty of calculating the hash, effectively preventing) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 443.89 Td (pre-computed rainbow table and dictionary attacks.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 426.39 Td (Q5: How does the proposal acceptance logic prevent race conditions?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 408.89 Td (A: In proposalController.js, accepting a bid sets the proposal to 'accepted',) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 395.39 Td (updates the Job status to 'in-progress', and executes Proposal.updateMany\(\) to) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 381.89 Td (atomically reject all competing bids on that job in a single database operation.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 364.39 Td (Q6: How is the average star rating computed?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 346.89 Td (A: On each review submission, all reviews for the reviewee are queried, their) Tj ET
