0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 319.89 Td (and saved in the User model.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 302.39 Td (Q7: What is an Axios Interceptor?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 284.89 Td (A: An interceptor is middleware for HTTP requests. In src/utils/api.js, it) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 271.39 Td (automatically injects the current user's Bearer token into request headers before) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 257.89 Td (leaving the browser.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 240.39 Td (Q8: What is the role of Mongoose in this project?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 222.89 Td (A: Mongoose is an Object Data Modeling \(ODM\) library that provides schema) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 209.39 Td (validation, type casting, query building, and relational population for MongoDB) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 195.89 Td (documents.) Tj ET
0.100 0.250 0.550 rg BT /F2 9.5 Tf 54.00 178.39 Td (Q9: What is React Context API and how is it used here?) Tj ET
0.150 0.150 0.150 rg BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54.00 160.89 Td (A: AuthContext broadcasts user state, authentication status, login, register, and) Tj ET
